{"2827820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Relic: First Guardian", "steam_appid": 2827820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4861130, 4891540], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since its launch, Project Cloud Games have been working round the clock to improve the game, with the current focus fully on fixing technical issues and performance. We have already released 15 patches, but we are not stopping there. The next patch is being worked on. You have our time, dedication, determination, and word that we will continue to do everything in our power to be worthy of your support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a small and passionate core team of a dozen people, Project Cloud Games has created a fresh new take on combat, with a heavy emphasis on balancing action and vulnerability, their unique, dark, and gritty spin on classic Korean stories has been in the making for six years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transformed into an apocalyptic wasteland by the destruction of the great relic, the once-prosperous realm of Arsilthus lies in ruins. Set in a dark and haunting atmosphere enriched by the tapestry of Korean folklore and ancient mythology, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it falls upon you to mend this shattered land and honour the memories of those who came before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/cfbc8f03efd86a6415f1f2f1b3d433f4.poster.avif?t=1787820323\" width=608 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/cfbc8f03efd86a6415f1f2f1b3d433f4.webm?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/cfbc8f03efd86a6415f1f2f1b3d433f4.mp4?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast Paced Brutal Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Relic approaches combat differently - delivering freedom in attack, intensity in survival. Unleash an unstoppable onslaught with attacks that cost zero resources, allowing you to strike continuously with relentless creativity and consistency. Your stamina gauge is reserved strictly for high-stakes defence like dodging and blocking, while high-power magic operates on cooldowns and a dedicated meter. Attack without limits, defend with absolute precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/07787b5414d74ab8e5ad5085d60130d6.poster.avif?t=1787820323\" width=608 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/07787b5414d74ab8e5ad5085d60130d6.webm?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/07787b5414d74ab8e5ad5085d60130d6.mp4?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Shattered, Semi-Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a vast, interconnected realm filled with forgotten ruins, hidden dungeons, and atmospheric landscapes. The world of Arsilthus rewards curious Guardians who venture off the beaten path with ancient artifacts, secret encounters, and pieces of lost lore buried deep within its ruined regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/869271bf9a3467858a3bb916a5e30a9e.poster.avif?t=1787820323\" width=608 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/869271bf9a3467858a3bb916a5e30a9e.webm?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/869271bf9a3467858a3bb916a5e30a9e.mp4?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confront Up to 80 Tragic Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into battle against up to 80 mythic encounters - each a dark, standalone folktale brought to life, bound to a tragic lore that can only be laid to rest through ultimate victory. Adapt or perish: no two legends fight alike, and a strategy that slays one nightmare offers no guarantee of surviving the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/58e36585202c92b2d97bc673e2d637fd.poster.avif?t=1787820323\" width=608 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/58e36585202c92b2d97bc673e2d637fd.webm?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/58e36585202c92b2d97bc673e2d637fd.mp4?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons Woven with Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command five distinct weapon masteries: Sword &amp; Shield, Battle Staff, Daggers, Two-Handed Weapons, or the Longsword. Without a single duplicate weapon to be found - every single item is a bespoke, one-of-a-kind creation with its own tragic history. Discovering a new blade means uncovering a piece of the world's past, transforming your arsenal into a personal collection of living legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/3041b17883c725ead4af8d63dc85d94f.poster.avif?t=1787820323\" width=608 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/3041b17883c725ead4af8d63dc85d94f.webm?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/3041b17883c725ead4af8d63dc85d94f.mp4?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Ancient Weapon Skill Trees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a deeper bond with your chosen armoury through specialised skill trees powered by relic energy. Channel forgotten power into game-changing passives alongside awe-striking, visually spectacular ultimate abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/2e322607583214d379c7fe064dc49ddc.poster.avif?t=1787820323\" width=608 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/2e322607583214d379c7fe064dc49ddc.webm?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/2e322607583214d379c7fe064dc49ddc.mp4?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unbound Build Freedom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget traditional levelling - your power is forged entirely through the gear and Relics you discover. Collecting and equipping relics is as much about augmenting your character as it is about uncovering the world's past. With over 70 unique passive effects scattered that alter combat tempo and skill, the relic system encourages you to experiment endlessly. Freely swap game-changing passives, manipulate attack tempos, and tailor your build on the fly - giving you complete freedom to adapt.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since its launch, Project Cloud Games have been working round the clock to improve the game, with the current focus fully on fixing technical issues and performance. We have already released 15 patches, but we are not stopping there. The next patch is being worked on. You have our time, dedication, determination, and word that we will continue to do everything in our power to be worthy of your support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a small and passionate core team of a dozen people, Project Cloud Games has created a fresh new take on combat, with a heavy emphasis on balancing action and vulnerability, their unique, dark, and gritty spin on classic Korean stories has been in the making for six years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transformed into an apocalyptic wasteland by the destruction of the great relic, the once-prosperous realm of Arsilthus lies in ruins. Set in a dark and haunting atmosphere enriched by the tapestry of Korean folklore and ancient mythology, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it falls upon you to mend this shattered land and honour the memories of those who came before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/cfbc8f03efd86a6415f1f2f1b3d433f4.poster.avif?t=1787820323\" width=608 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/cfbc8f03efd86a6415f1f2f1b3d433f4.webm?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827820/extras/cfbc8f03efd86a6415f1f2f1b3d433f4.mp4?t=1787820323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast Paced Brutal Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_para